---
title: Rice pilaf
servings: 4
tags: [side, basics]
source: Invented for this repository
---

Rinse the @short-grain rice{300%g} until the water runs clear, then drain well.

Soften the @yellow onion{1/2}, finely diced, in @unsalted butter{20%g} in a
#saucepan with a lid{} over medium-low heat, ~{6%minutes}.

Stir in the rice and cook ~{2%minutes} until the grains look chalky. Add
@water{450%ml} and @flaked sea salt{1%tsp}, bring to a boil, then cover and drop
the heat to its lowest setting for ~{12%minutes}.

Take off the heat and leave covered ~{10%minutes} before forking through.
